  "_doc": "US-524 AC-6: ONE fixture matrix, read by every realization's parity test (cycle, batch sequential, batch parallel, pair-cli run --card). `args` are the raw autonomy arguments; `labels` the card's labels at the stage boundaries (`labelsAtMerge` at the merge boundary when they differ; `prLabelsAtMerge` the PR's labels there — its `risk:*` replaces the card's, default = the card's); `implement` is the decision at the first stage boundary of a fresh card; `merge` the decision at the merge boundary (null when `until` never reaches it); `final` is what a batch row says. The decision names are autonomy-policy.mjs's own.",
  "rows": [
